                                                "sense_id": "ab498cc0-6e7e-31fd-ba6f-03aeb48eb98e",
                                                "text": "The benzos, it turns out, are just as highly addicting as the barbs, but they do have a much lower potential to cause death by overdose. […] The barbs became one of the most widely abused classes of drugs in the 1960s and 1970s."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "barb",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4542b0b0-d14f-34ff-bf8f-4f01294e3ba8",
